{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"16","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"二进制数 $10110101$ 对应的十进制数是（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"$169$"},{"key":"B","content":"$177$"},{"key":"C","content":"$181$"},{"key":"D","content":"$185$"}],"correctAnswer":"C","analysis":"按权展开：$10110101=1\\times2^7+0\\times2^6+1\\times2^5+1\\times2^4+0\\times2^3+1\\times2^2+0\\times2^1+1\\times2^0=128+32+16+4+1=181$。选项 A、B、D 分别是漏加某一位权值后的结果，均不正确。","difficulty":2,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"二进制转十进制"},{"name":"按权展开求和"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=16","clientKey":"SD-01#0001"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"16","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"十进制数 $45$ 用十六进制表示为（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"$2C$"},{"key":"B","content":"$2D$"},{"key":"C","content":"$2E$"},{"key":"D","content":"$4D$"}],"correctAnswer":"B","analysis":"用 $16$ 除 $45$：$45\\div16=2$ 余 $13$，余数 $13$ 对应十六进制数码 $D$；商 $2$ 作为高位，故结果为 $2D$。选项 A、C 的个位数码偏小或偏大，D 把商写成了 $4$，均错误。","difficulty":1,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"十进制转十六进制"},{"name":"除基取余法"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=16","clientKey":"SD-01#0002"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"16","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"在计算机中，$1$ 位八进制数需要用（　）位二进制数表示，$1$ 位十六进制数需要用（　）位二进制数表示。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"$3$ 和 $4$"},{"key":"B","content":"$4$ 和 $3$"},{"key":"C","content":"$2$ 和 $4$"},{"key":"D","content":"$3$ 和 $3$"}],"correctAnswer":"A","analysis":"因为 $2^3=8$，所以 $1$ 位八进制数由 $3$ 位二进制数表示；因为 $2^4=16$，所以 $1$ 位十六进制数由 $4$ 位二进制数表示。其余选项把两种进制对应的位数弄反或写错，均不正确。","difficulty":1,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"进制位权关系"},{"name":"八进制与十六进制的二进制表示"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=16","clientKey":"SD-01#0003"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"16","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"十进制小数 $0.625$ 转换为二进制小数是（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"$0.101$"},{"key":"B","content":"$0.110$"},{"key":"C","content":"$0.011$"},{"key":"D","content":"$0.1001$"}],"correctAnswer":"A","analysis":"小数部分用“乘 $2$ 取整”法：$0.625\\times2=1.25$ 取整 $1$；$0.25\\times2=0.5$ 取整 $0$；$0.5\\times2=1.0$ 取整 $1$。按取整顺序排列得 $0.101$。选项 B、C 的位序或取值不对，D 多算了一位，均不正确。","difficulty":2,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"十进制小数转二进制"},{"name":"乘基取整法"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=16","clientKey":"SD-01#0004"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"16","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"十六进制数 $3A$ 与 $27$ 相加的结果用十六进制表示为（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"$51$"},{"key":"B","content":"$61$"},{"key":"C","content":"$62$"},{"key":"D","content":"$71$"}],"correctAnswer":"B","analysis":"按位相加：$A+7=10+7=17=16+1$，本位写 $1$、向高位进 $1$；高位 $3+2+1=6$。故结果为 $61$。选项 A 漏掉进位，C、D 高位数错误，均不正确。","difficulty":2,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"十六进制加法"},{"name":"进位规则"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=16","clientKey":"SD-01#0005"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"17","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"某机器采用 $8$ 位补码表示整数，则补码 $11101110$ 所表示的真值是（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"$-17$"},{"key":"B","content":"$-18$"},{"key":"C","content":"$-19$"},{"key":"D","content":"$238$"}],"correctAnswer":"B","analysis":"补码最高位为 $1$，说明是负数。求其绝对值：对 $11101110$ 逐位取反得 $00010001$，再加 $1$ 得 $00010010$，即十进制 $18$，故真值为 $-18$。选项 D 把它按无符号数解读；A、C 数值偏差，均不正确。","difficulty":3,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"补码表示"},{"name":"补码求真值"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=17","clientKey":"SD-01#0006"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"17","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"在 IEEE 754 标准的 $32$ 位单精度浮点数格式中，符号位、阶码和尾数所占位数依次为（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"$1$、$8$、$23$"},{"key":"B","content":"$1$、$7$、$24$"},{"key":"C","content":"$1$、$11$、$20$"},{"key":"D","content":"$1$、$8$、$24$"}],"correctAnswer":"A","analysis":"IEEE 754 单精度格式共 $32$ 位：符号位 $1$ 位，阶码 $8$ 位，尾数 $23$ 位。选项 B 把阶码与尾数位数分配错，C 是错误分配，D 总位数超出 $32$ 位，均不正确。","difficulty":2,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"IEEE 754 浮点数"},{"name":"浮点数格式"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=17","clientKey":"SD-01#0007"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"17","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"在汉字信息处理系统中，汉字在计算机内部存储、处理和传输时所使用的统一编码是（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"输入码"},{"key":"B","content":"机内码"},{"key":"C","content":"字形码"},{"key":"D","content":"地址码"}],"correctAnswer":"B","analysis":"输入码用于把汉字录入计算机，如拼音码；机内码是汉字在计算机内部存储和处理时使用的统一编码；字形码用于显示和打印汉字的字形。因此选 B。选项 A、C 用途不符，D 不是汉字编码类型。","difficulty":3,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"汉字编码"},{"name":"机内码"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=17","clientKey":"SD-01#0008"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"17","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"在标准 ASCII 编码中，大写字母 $A$ 的编码为 $65$，则小写字母 $a$ 的编码为（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"$61$"},{"key":"B","content":"$90$"},{"key":"C","content":"$97$"},{"key":"D","content":"$122$"}],"correctAnswer":"C","analysis":"在 ASCII 码表中，同一字母的小写编码比大写编码大 $32$，即 $65+32=97$，故 $a$ 的编码为 $97$。选项 B、D 分别是 $Z$、$z$ 的编码；A 不是对应字母的编码，均不正确。","difficulty":1,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"ASCII 编码"},{"name":"字符编码规律"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=17","clientKey":"SD-01#0009"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"17","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"关于计算机中定点数与浮点数的表示，下列说法正确的是（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"浮点数由阶码和尾数组成，其可表示的数值范围通常比相同位数的定点数大"},{"key":"B","content":"定点数只能表示整数，不能表示纯小数"},{"key":"C","content":"浮点数的精度在所有情况下都高于定点数"},{"key":"D","content":"定点数运算的实现比浮点数运算更复杂"}],"correctAnswer":"A","analysis":"浮点数用阶码表示小数点位置、尾数表示有效数字，因此在相同字长下可表示的范围远大于定点数，故 A 正确。定点数既能表示整数也能表示纯小数，B 错；浮点数位数固定时其有效数字位数并不总是高于定点数，C 错；浮点运算需要对齐阶码等步骤，实现比定点运算更复杂，D 恰好相反。","difficulty":4,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"定点数表示"},{"name":"浮点数表示"},{"name":"数值范围与精度"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=17","clientKey":"SD-01#0010"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"18","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"设有两个二进制数 $X=1010$、$Y=1100$，则 $X\\oplus Y$（异或）的结果是（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"$0110$"},{"key":"B","content":"$1000$"},{"key":"C","content":"$1110$"},{"key":"D","content":"$0100$"}],"correctAnswer":"A","analysis":"异或运算规则是“相同为 $0$，不同为 $1$”。逐位计算：$1\\oplus1=0$，$0\\oplus1=1$，$1\\oplus0=1$，$0\\oplus0=0$，结果为 $0110$。选项 C 是与运算结果，B、D 位数不对应，均不正确。","difficulty":2,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"逻辑异或运算"},{"name":"位运算"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=18","clientKey":"SD-01#0011"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"18","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"若要用海明码对 $8$ 位数据进行检错和纠错，则至少需要附加（　）位校验位。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"$3$"},{"key":"B","content":"$4$"},{"key":"C","content":"$5$"},{"key":"D","content":"$8$"}],"correctAnswer":"B","analysis":"海明码校验位数 $k$ 需满足 $2^k\\ge n+k+1$，其中数据位 $n=8$。取 $k=3$ 时 $2^3=8<8+3+1=12$，不满足；取 $k=4$ 时 $2^4=16\\ge13$，满足要求。故至少需要 $4$ 位校验位，选 B。","difficulty":4,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"海明码"},{"name":"纠错编码"},{"name":"校验位计算"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=18","clientKey":"SD-01#0012"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"18","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"关于奇偶校验码，下列说法正确的是（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"既能发现错误又能确定错误的具体位置"},{"key":"B","content":"能发现一位错误，但不能确定错误发生在哪一位"},{"key":"C","content":"只能检测出偶数个位同时出错的情况"},{"key":"D","content":"不需要附加校验位即可工作"}],"correctAnswer":"B","analysis":"奇偶校验通过增加一位校验位使 $1$ 的个数为奇或偶，能发现奇数个位出错，但无法定位具体是哪一位，更不能纠错，故 B 正确。A 夸大了其能力；C 说法片面；D 与定义矛盾。","difficulty":2,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"奇偶校验码"},{"name":"检错与纠错"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=18","clientKey":"SD-01#0013"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"18","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"两个 $8$ 位补码数 $01111111$ 与 $00000001$ 相加，其结果是（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"$10000000$，且发生溢出"},{"key":"B","content":"$10000000$，且未发生溢出"},{"key":"C","content":"$01111111$，且发生溢出"},{"key":"D","content":"$11111111$，且发生溢出"}],"correctAnswer":"A","analysis":"$01111111$ 为 $+127$，$00000001$ 为 $+1$，相加真值为 $+128$。$8$ 位补码正数范围为 $+127$，$+128$ 已超出范围，故发生溢出，和的机器数为 $10000000$。因此选 A。其余选项的溢出判断或数值均错误。","difficulty":4,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"补码加法"},{"name":"溢出判断"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=18","clientKey":"SD-01#0014"}
{"subjectId":"6","outlineId":"18","questionType":"SINGLE_CHOICE","stem":"已知逻辑表达式满足 $A\\land B=0$ 且 $A\\lor B=1$，则 $A$ 与 $B$ 的关系是（　）。","stemFormat":"MARKDOWN","options":[{"key":"A","content":"$A=B$"},{"key":"B","content":"$A=1$，$B=0$"},{"key":"C","content":"$B=\\bar{A}$（二者互补）"},{"key":"D","content":"无法确定"}],"correctAnswer":"C","analysis":"$A\\land B=0$ 说明两者不同时为 $1$；$A\\lor B=1$ 说明两者至少有一个为 $1$。合起来即两者必有一个为 $1$、另一个为 $0$，故 $A$ 与 $B$ 互补，$B=\\bar{A}$。选项 B 只是其中一种情况，A、D 与条件矛盾或不足，均不正确。","difficulty":3,"knowledgePoints":[{"name":"逻辑与或运算"},{"name":"逻辑等式"}],"sourceType":"AI_GENERATED","sourceLicense":"SELF","sourceRef":"SD-01;outline=18","clientKey":"SD-01#0015"}
